                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237473063",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199677820611",
                            "num_reviews": 28,
                            "playtime_forever": 340,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 137,
                            "last_played": 1791940909
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "10/10. I am no longer legally allowed within 50 feet of a chicken.\n\nUltimate Chicken Horse is the only game where you can spend 5 minutes carefully constructing a beautiful obstacle course just to watch your friends die to a single block you placed 3 seconds ago.\n\nThe concept is simple:\n\nBuild a level.\n\nMake it slightly more dangerous.\n\nWatch your friends suffer.\n\nRealize you also have to play the level.\n\nRegret your life choices.\n\nEvery round is a beautiful demonstration of why humanity should never be trusted with unlimited creative freedom.\n\nThe art style is adorable, the gameplay is genuinely clever, and the amount of psychological warfare you can commit with a single well-placed trap is honestly impressive.\n\nYou start the game as friends. You end the game as four animals with unresolved legal disputes.\n\nPros:\n\nFunny enough to cause permanent damage to friendships\n\nInfinite ways to be an absolute menace\n\nSimple to learn, difficult to master\n\nCute animals committing atrocities against one another\n\nCons:\n\nMy friends have started treating me differently\n\nTrust is no longer a viable concept\n\nI have developed a personal vendetta against whoever invented spikes\n\nIn conclusion, this is not a platformer. It is a social experiment disguised as a children's cartoon.\n\nWould recommend.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791731948,
